[bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]operation-leases[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ownership-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation-leases: add reusable claimed-workspace lifecycle support for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synchronous jobs, monitors, and detached procs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reset-and-replay conflict recovery[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]disposable-retry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after operation-leases[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]disposable-retry: recover conflicts by resetting only leased [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machine-owned checkouts and replaying bounded idempotent operations.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Approval and task launches off the primary checkout[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]approval-launches[dim] · [dim][/dim]after disposable-retry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]approval-launches: move approval-time plan archiving plus epic and task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch orchestration into durable operational workspace leases.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Background bead mutations off canonical primary clones[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]background-mutators[dim] · [dim][/dim]after disposable-retry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]background-mutators: route runner and scheduled bead writers through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writable workspace-local stores while retaining canonical stores for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reads.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generic primary-sidecar auto-sync[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sidecar-autosync[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ownership-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar-autosync: add opt-in clean fast-forward synchronization for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plans, beads, research, and arbitrary configured sidecars.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end ownership audit and regression gates[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]invariant-audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after approval-launches, background-mutators, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]sidecar-autosync[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant-audit: prove primary-checkout immutability, disposable retry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]safety, and sidecar convergence across automated workflows.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-mq","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-mq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-61fc0dfe0e32f7603d081d18d98ce418","started_at":"2026-08-16T03:44:01.403046+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"c708a675e00ecfb3a8d9da1c40628616bd31ded904fe2c246e370984f24c56ac","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mq.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mq.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"5c8f8f227b644f2e5035a26b896b47db590149d68430f4b1359fce73a4563a08","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mq.4/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"4574f630b97cc4e17032f77d0310187759684827bce8bc4903023edbacf1c02b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mq.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"3ca6d0f71eabd76876b687b1fa4a407302e24a0bac748694c8a05c59ae011a76","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mq.4/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4113},"state":{"digest":"c0571def73f8e92c22ac0f39bb51a897bd51f0e0f519